# 2026-11-21: the Galaxy S26 (SM-S942Q) LiteRT-LM GPU rows of five int4 / int8 Hub files, LFM2.5-350M and LFM2-700M
# int4 and int8 and Qwen3.5 0.8B int8, one of three sittings (the two LFM2-2.6B files:
# matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-current-lfm2-26b-android.cells; the two LFM2-2.6B-Exp files:
# matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-current-lfm2-26b-exp-android.cells),
# on the side build v0.19.0-pregpu: LiteRT-LM v0.19.0 (771b06e1) with its prebuilt GPU accelerator
# libLiteRtGpuAccelerator.so loaded at run time (android/engine-pins.json litert-lm.v0.19.0-pregpu), the build of the
# weekly dashboard-text-v1 GPU rows and of matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-composite-android.cells (the GPU-composite
# files of the five models of the three sittings). Same model ids, files and cooldowns as these files' rows of
# matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-public-android.cells, which ran them on LiteRT-LM's public prebuilt binaries (GPU accelerator
# compiled in).
# Task: native-benchmark-1024x256 = litert_lm_advanced_main --benchmark, prefill forced to exactly 1024 tokens,
# decode 256, context 2048 (methodology/protocol-gemma4.md "The spec").
# Files: the Hub files of 2026-11-20, each read at the repo revision on its comment line and checked against the Hub
# API's LFS sha256 (size and sha256 below; the local copies hashed again on 2026-11-21); file= is the checked
# copy's path from the repo root (the job runs the runner there; .dashboard/ is not in git).
# First row = the Android llama.cpp session anchor row of matrices/anchors.cells byte for byte.
# Cooldowns: the runner's 120 s (no cooldown=). No runs= (3 runs per row, round by round).
# Text check before the sitting: these five files' rows of matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-textcheck-pregpu-current-android.cells.
# Run from the repo root with the phone reserved for the whole run (the job does not reserve or free it):
#   BENCH_SITTING=1 python3 scripts/dashboard_job.py s26 --cells matrices/lfm2-qwen35-s26-pregpu-current-small-android.cells --suffix lfm2-qwen35-small --once --hold-held-by <pid that reserved the phone> --no-post
# The campaign name holds `dashboard`; the page reads this file's rows only once the dashboard lists this file.
android llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-0.6B-GGUF short-chat anchor=1 runs=3 file=Qwen3-0.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf
# litert-community/LFM2.5-350M at e693f9e62b4a9186ec7fe66740161f07d3a1cb11:
#   LFM2.5-350M_int4.litertlm 247,808,000 B, sha256 c29a41cdf4148ec9f4b6e57f8e598728a05a189fdc7ca0764b013b78f9dfd52f
android litert-lm litert-community/LFM2.5-350M/int4 native-benchmark-1024x256 backend=gpu engine-build=v0.19.0-pregpu file=./.dashboard/lfm2-qwen35-models/LFM2.5-350M_int4.litertlm context-tokens=2048
